<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GRUPO MODELO CUT.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GRUPO MODELO CUT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Thursday it cut its rating on the shares of Grupo Modelo SA to a sell from hold.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1.90 pesos to 73.5 in Mexico.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
